  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan aims for the top six of the Refinement Path Convention so he can reach the Infallible inheritance and refine Immortal Gu Change Form there. He already holds the recipe from deals with Lang Ya land spirit.",
        "chapters": [
          843
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_refinement_path_convention",
          "inh_infallible_inheritance",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "char_lang_ya_land_spirit"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan searches an Eastern Sea island cliff for a cave he knows only from his previous life, the boyhood hideout of Li Xiao Yao, a Gu Immortal still some two hundred years from being born. The opening he settles on is too small even for his Xing Xiang Zi body, let alone his original eight-arm immortal zombie body. Change Form Immortal Gu lets him shrink and squeeze inside.",
        "chapters": [
          894
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "shrinking-to-enter-a-hidden-cave",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "reg_eastern_sea",
          "char_li_xiao_yao",
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Change Form Immortal Gu is the essence of transformation path itself. Reckless Savage Demon Venerable refined it to rank nine, and after that Demon Venerable died the rank nine Gu was destroyed, so later refiners start again from rank six. The Gu has been destroyed and refined dozens of times; it is usually rank six, rarely rank seven, and almost countable on two hands at rank eight. Fang Yuan again aims only at rank six. He spends the third and last of his Gu refining chances from Lang Ya land spirit on this Gu rather than on Fixed Immortal Travel, whose crucial material, light of the immemorial era, is missing and which matters less to him now than transformation path.",
        "chapters": [
          1065
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "transformation-path-standing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_reckless_savage_demon_venerable",
          "gu_fixed_immortal_travel"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "During a trading convention, Change Form Immortal Gu is called the essence of transformation path; with it a Gu Immortal can turn into any form, unlike ordinary transformation path practice limited to a few forms.",
        "chapters": [
          1298
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "transformation-path-standing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Change Form Immortal Gu becomes one of two cores in Fang Yuan’s new divination tortoise transformation killer move, alongside rank seven divination tortoise shell Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1302
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "divination-tortoise-transformation-core",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
